---
    import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
    import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
    import SeoHead from '../components/SeoHead.astro';
    import PageScripts from '../components/PageScripts.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <SeoHead
            title="Refund Policy | SafePlots"
            description="SafePlots Refund & Cancellation Policy - Learn about our refund terms for subscriptions and one-time services."
            canonical="https://safeplots.com/refund-policy/"
            keywords="Refund Policy, Cancellation Policy, SafePlots, Money Back Guarantee"
        />
    </head>
    <body class="page-legal">

        <Header />

        <main class="legal-content container">
            <div class="legal-hero">
                <div class="legal-kicker text-mono">Policy</div>
                <h1 class="section-title">Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
                <div class="legal-updated text-mono">
                    Last Updated: January 2026
                </div>
            </div>

            <section class="legal-summary" aria-label="Overview">
                <h2 class="legal-summary-title text-mono">Overview</h2>
                <div class="legal-summary-grid">
                    <div class="legal-summary-card">
                        <div class="legal-summary-card-title">
                            Subscriptions
                        </div>
                        <p class="legal-summary-card-desc">
                            Cancel anytime; cancellation typically takes effect
                            at the end of the billing cycle.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="legal-summary-card">
                        <div class="legal-summary-card-title">
                            One-Time Services
                        </div>
                        <p class="legal-summary-card-desc">
                            Refund eligibility depends on whether work has
                            started and any materials purchased.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="legal-summary-card">
                        <div class="legal-summary-card-title">Processing</div>
                        <p class="legal-summary-card-desc">
                            Requests are reviewed promptly; approved refunds are
                            processed to the original payment method.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <div class="legal-text">
                <h3>1. Overview</h3>
                <p>
                    At SafePlots, we strive to provide the best plot management
                    services. This policy outlines our approach to refunds and
                    cancellations for both subscription services and one-time
                    projects.
                </p>

                <h3>2. Subscription Cancellation</h3>
                <h4>2.1 Monthly Subscriptions</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        You may cancel your monthly subscription at any time.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Cancellation takes effect at the end of your current
                        billing cycle.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        No refund is provided for the current billing period.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        You will continue to receive services until the end of
                        the paid period.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        To cancel, contact us at least 7 days before your next
                        billing date.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h4>2.2 Annual Subscriptions</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Annual plans can be cancelled within 30 days of purchase
                        for a full refund.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        After 30 days, refunds may be prorated based on
                        remaining months.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Refund processing typically takes 7-10 business days.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        An administrative fee may apply for mid-term
                        cancellations.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h3>3. One-Time Service Cancellation</h3>
                <h4>3.1 Before Work Begins</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Full refund may be available if cancelled at least 48
                        hours before scheduled start.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Partial refund may apply if cancelled within 24-48 hours
                        before start.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        No refund for cancellations less than 24 hours before
                        start.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h4>3.2 After Work Has Started</h4>
                <p>
                    No refund once work has commenced. Payment for work
                    completed up to cancellation point may be required.
                    Materials purchased specifically for your project may be
                    non-refundable.
                </p>

                <h3>4. Refund Eligibility</h3>
                <p>You may be eligible for a full or partial refund if:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        Scheduled visits were not completed as per your plan
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Services provided were significantly different from what
                        was promised
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Technical issues prevented dashboard access for more
                        than 7 days
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        We were unable to access your property despite proper
                        notice
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h3>5. Non-Refundable Items</h3>
                <p>
                    Setup fees, drone survey fees (once conducted), custom
                    project materials, and third-party fees may be
                    non-refundable.
                </p>

                <h3>6. Suspension vs Cancellation</h3>
                <p>
                    <strong>Temporary Suspension:</strong> You may suspend for
                    up to 3 months without cancellation (no charges, no
                    visits).<br />
                    <strong>Permanent Cancellation:</strong> Terminates services
                    and access as per policy.
                </p>

                <h3>7. How to Request a Refund</h3>
                <ol>
                    <li>
                        Contact us at
                        <a href="mailto:admin@safeplots.com"
                            >admin@safeplots.com</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>Provide your account details and reason</li>
                    <li>Include any supporting documentation</li>
                </ol>
                <p>
                    Review: 3-5 business days. Processing: 7-10 business days
                    (if approved).
                </p>

                <h3>8. Force Majeure</h3>
                <p>
                    No refunds for interruptions due to natural disasters or
                    government restrictions. We may extend your period instead.
                </p>

                <h3>9. Contact Us</h3>
                <p>
                    SafePlots Customer Service<br />
                    Email:
                    <a href="mailto:admin@safeplots.com">admin@safeplots.com</a
                    ><br />
                    Phone: <a href="tel:+917780391340">+91 77803 91340</a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </main>

        <Footer />

        <PageScripts />
    </body>
</html>
